        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T01:27:16.928Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "This post updates the pattern introduced in the 2023 series Build an end-to-end MLOps pipeline for visual quality inspection at the edge for the current Amazon SageMaker Python SDK v3.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/fleet-wide-computer-vision-lifecycle-at-the-edge-with-sagemaker-sdk-v3/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T17:56:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T01:27:16.928Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "It replaces the since-deprecated Amazon SageMaker Edge Manager with Amazon SageMaker Neo for edge optimization.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/fleet-wide-computer-vision-lifecycle-at-the-edge-with-sagemaker-sdk-v3/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T17:56:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T01:27:16.928Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The training half is a single SageMaker Pipeline, parameterized by camera, that runs 13 steps per execution.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/fleet-wide-computer-vision-lifecycle-at-the-edge-with-sagemaker-sdk-v3/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T17:56:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T01:27:16.928Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Past the gate, the model is compiled with SageMaker Neo for the configured edge target, and only then registered in the SageMaker Model Registry.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/fleet-wide-computer-vision-lifecycle-at-the-edge-with-sagemaker-sdk-v3/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T17:56:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T01:27:16.928Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Defining the training pipeline with SDK v3",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/fleet-wide-computer-vision-lifecycle-at-the-edge-with-sagemaker-sdk-v3/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T17:56:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T01:27:16.928Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "SDK v3 reorganized the SageMaker Python SDK into modular packages, and the imports show the new shape of the library:",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/fleet-wide-computer-vision-lifecycle-at-the-edge-with-sagemaker-sdk-v3/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T17:56:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T01:27:16.928Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "First, SDK v3 validates the pipeline’s execution role against live IAM while building the pipeline definition.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/fleet-wide-computer-vision-lifecycle-at-the-edge-with-sagemaker-sdk-v3/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-26T17:56:58.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T01:27:16.928Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In this post, I showed a working SageMaker SDK v3 reference architecture for the fleet-scale computer vision lifecycle.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/fleet-wide-computer-vision-lifecycle-at-the-edge-with-sagemaker-sdk-v3/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
